// Config for scripts/run_eval_knowledge.py — the Micropolis domain-knowledge
// test (True/False/Unknown statements, scored per model).
//
// The "models" list is the default set used across the freeciv world: the same
// five models appear verbatim in run_bin_condition.py, run_combined_condition.py,
// run_generate_scenario.py, run_scenario_enumeration.py, run_scenario_weighting.py,
// run_structured_mixture.py, run_trajectory_condition.py and
// run_tutorial_conditions.py.
//
// Only "models" and the optional "provider_concurrency" are read by
// run_eval_knowledge.py; the rest of the keys are here so this file also
// works with the other micropolis scripts.
// analyze_knowledge.py also reads "models", to recover the provider/name ids
// that the cached response filenames have flattened.
{
  "models": "models-base.json5",
}
